===Etymology===
From earlier *''xabris'', borrowed from {{etyl|gem-pro|fi}} {{m|gem-pro|*habraz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*hafraz||he-goat}}, compare Old Norse {{m|non|hafr}}. Cognates include Estonian {{m|et|kaber}}, Karelian {{m|krl|kabris}}.

