===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# A mountain [[goat]], more specifically called ''[[alppikauris]]'' or ''[[alppivuohi]]'', {{taxlink|Capra ibex|species|noshow=1|ver=161206}}.
# Any small [[deer]] of unspecified species, especially a [[roe deer]].
# One born under the sign of [[Capricorn]].

